sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Clerk
    participant B as React Client
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as Data Store

    C->>B: Select student & months
    B->>A: GET /api/fees/dues/:studentId
    A->>D: Read student, feeStructures, receipts
    D-->>A: Class fees, transport, paid months
    A->>A: Due = Tuition + Transport + Late - Discount
    A-->>B: 200 {breakdown, totalDue}
    B-->>C: Show computed dues

    C->>B: Enter amount, payment mode, Save
    B->>A: POST /api/fees/receipts
    A->>D: nextSeq('receipt')
    D-->>A: Sequence number
    A->>D: insertOne(receipts)
    A->>D: insertOne(dailyAccounts, income entry)
    D-->>A: Saved documents
    A-->>B: 201 {receipt}
    B-->>C: Show printable receipt
    C->>B: Print / Email receipt
